OL,3,GNEWSASiblings at centre of Dundee knife
OL,4,Agirl video sentenced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bulgarian man has been given a
OL,7,Fcommunity sentence for assaulting a
OL,8,F12-year-old girl who later brandished
OL,9,Fan axe and knife at him in what became
OL,10,Fa viral video.
OL,12,FIlia Belov, 23, was previously found
OL,13,Fguilty of uttering sexual remarks to a
OL,14,Fgroup of girls in Dundee before
OL,15,Fthrowing one of them to the ground.
OL,17,FHe was ordered to complete 300 hours of
OL,18,Funpaid work, 18 months of supervision
OL,19,Fand placed on the sex offenders
OL,20,Fregister for the same period.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
